<title>POLAND: BWR AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BWR AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.29 vs    0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.73 vs    0.82</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  2.94 vs    2.10</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.50 vs    4.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.59 vs    1.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.69 vs    3.17</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 24.49 vs   13.66</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	57.47 vs   32.84</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
